@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Inter, Helvetica, Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam RoundCorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3

title Container Diagram — Lean Desk (5 Routes)

actor "Trader" as User #0ea5e9
rectangle "Next.js 16 App\nlightweight-charts" as Next #ffffff
rectangle "Frontend Cache\nmem + sessionStorage\nSWR dedupe 400k cap" as FrontCache #f8fafc
rectangle "Shell + Sidebar\n5 APPS" as Shell #f1f5f9
rectangle "FastAPI :8000\n11 routers" as FastAPI #ffffff
rectangle "Service Layer\nmarket idx screener\nvalidator stockbit" as Services #f8fafc
rectangle "Cache Seam\nTTL_POLICY + WAL" as CacheSeam #f1f5f9
database "cache.db\nkv_cache WAL" as DB #e2e8f0
cloud "IDX Daily Summary" as IDX #e0f2fe
cloud "yfinance" as YF #fef9c3
cloud "TradingView" as TV #fce7f3
cloud "Stockbit" as SB #dcfce7

User --> Next : navigates
Next --> Shell : renders
Next --> FrontCache : get/set cache
FrontCache --> FastAPI : fetch /api/*
FastAPI --> Services : route handlers
Services --> CacheSeam : cache.serve
CacheSeam --> DB : get_fresh / set
CacheSeam --> IDX : on miss
CacheSeam --> YF : on miss
CacheSeam --> TV : rotation
Services --> SB : broker (JWT optional)

note right of FrontCache
 TTL_TABLE mirrors backend TTL_POLICY
 mem -> ss -> network (SWR)
end note

note bottom of DB
 /backend/data/cache.db
 prune 5k / 30d
end note
@enduml
